# Send the build only what the Dockerfile actually COPYs from the context:
#   - conf/      (COPY conf /conf)
#   - keys/*.key (COPY keys/ /tmp/keys/)
# The Dockerfile and .dockerignore are always read by the builder regardless of
# the rules below, so they don't need to be allow-listed. docker-bake.hcl is
# read from the filesystem by `docker buildx bake`, not from the build context.

# 1) Ignore everything by default.
*

# 2) Re-include only the directories copied into images.
!conf/
!keys/

# 3) Drop docs/noise that live inside the allow-listed directories.
keys/README.md
